<title>USA: United Healthcare Q3 shr down to $0.45.</title>
<headline>United Healthcare Q3 shr down to $0.45.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNITED HEALTHCARE CORPORATION</p>
<p>					EARNINGS REPORT</p>
<p>			 (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				(unaudited)</p>
<p>						   Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				   Sep 30, 1996	    Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Revenues			  $2,587,358		$1,215,536</p>
<p> Net earnings			  91,227		    93,670</p>
<p>Convertible preferred  </p>
<p>  stock dividends		   (7,188)			  --</p>
<p>Net earnings applicable to</p>
<p>  common shareholders		84,039		    93,670</p>
<p> Net earnings per common share     0.45			0.53</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding		187,130		   177,070</p>
<p>						   Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				   Sep 30, 1996	    Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Revenues			  $7,397,651		$3,477,316</p>
<p> Net earnings		     260,494 *		   272,981</p>
<p>Convertible preferred  </p>
<p>  stock dividends		  (21,564)			  --</p>
<p>Net earnings applicable to</p>
<p>  common shareholders	     238,930		   272,981</p>
<p> Net earnings per common share   1.29 *			1.55</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding		185,030		   176,615</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding the non-operating merger costs associated with the acquisition of HealthWise of America Inc of $14.9 million, or $0.05 per common share, and the provision for future losses on two multi-year contracts of $45.0 million, or $0.15 per common share, net earnings for the nine-month period ended September 30, 1996 would have been $297,074, or 1.49 per common share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
